      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Creston%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was founded in 1856, marking over a century and a half of community life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofcreston.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every year the annual Creston Booster Days festival draws locals and visitors for a celebration of small‑town charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofcreston.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The village recently spruced up its detention ponds, spraying them this week to keep weeds at bay.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofcreston.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic water tower, a local landmark, is back online after passing all required water tests.",
